        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"Days of America\"\n- Organizations: BlackHawk\n- People: Dave Robbins, Henry Paul, Lee Thomas Miller, Van Stephenson\n\nFacts:\n- In 1992, BlackHawk was founded as an American country music group.\n- In 1992, Henry Paul, Van Stephenson, and Dave Robbins founded BlackHawk.\n- In BlackHawk, Henry Paul performed lead vocals, mandolin, and acoustic guitar.\n- In BlackHawk, Van Stephenson performed background vocals and electric guitar.\n- In BlackHawk, Dave Robbins performed background vocals and keyboards.\n- The song \"Days of America\" was written by BlackHawk members Dave Robbins and Henry Paul with Lee Thomas Miller.",
